  "notable_quotes": [
    "In PVSA simulations for coal (12.5% CO2) and steel (25.5% CO2) flue gas, F4_MIL-140A(Ce) outperformed benchmark sorbents in recovery and purity under most conditions.",
    "Step-shaped isotherms can deliver high working capacity and selectivity only when process conditions fully exploit the isotherm step position.",
    "Phase-change MOFs can offer an optimal compromise among working capacity, selectivity, and mild regeneration because they adsorb strongly above a threshold pressure."
